  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> be the solution of the differential equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>,&nbsp;then&nbsp;the minimum value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to :"
  },
